{"hw":"ἀπολογέομαι","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἀπολογέομαι</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἀπολογ-έομαι</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">aor.</span> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <span class=\"gk\">ἀπελογησάμην</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ba.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">41</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Antipho</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.13</span> </span>, but <abbr>f.l. in</abbr> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Sph.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">261c</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">An.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.6.3</span> </span>; also <span class=\"lex-gram\">aor.</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Pass.</span> </span> <span class=\"gk\">ἀπελογήθην</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Antipho</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.3.1</span> </span>, al., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Alex.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">12</span> </span> (prob. suprious in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">HG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.4.13</span> </span>): <span class=\"lex-gram\">pf.</span> <span class=\"gk\">ἀπολελόγημαι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">And.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.33</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Isoc.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">12.218</span> </span> (in pass. sense, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">R.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">607b</sp